[I] Spawn FastCGI applications

[T] spawn-fcgi, from the lighttpd project, is used to spawn FastCGI
[T] applications. It binds to IPv4/IPv6 and Unix domain sockets and supports
[T] privilege separation, chroot and daemontools supervise.

[U] https://redmine.lighttpd.net/projects/spawn-fcgi/

[A] Spawn-fcgi Authors
